OL,3,AMajor tech stocks plunge as US midterms
OL,4,Aadd to fears of AI slowdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe tech-heavy Nasdaq composite index
OL,7,Fclosed down by more than 5.5%, losing
OL,8,Fan estimated $2.5tn (#1.9tn) in market
OL,9,Fvalue, according to Dow Jones data,
OL,10,Fwhile other key US stock indexes also
OL,11,Fsaw big losses in their worst days
OL,12,Fsince 2025.
OL,14,FThe sell-off comes on top of broader
OL,15,Fconcerns about whether the huge amounts
OL,16,Fbeing spent on AI will pay off.
